---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import avatar from "../assets/images/avatar.png";
---

<div id="left-intro">
  <div id="intro-heading">
    Hi there. I'm <span class="accent">Marina</span>, <br />a
    <span class="accent">UX Writer</span> at Turnitin.
  </div>
  <div id="intro-description">
    <p>
      I’m a UX writer and content designer with a strong technical background. I
      specialize in crafting clear, scalable documentation and UX copy, while
      also creating systems and processes that solve problems at scale.
    </p>

    <p>
      My goal is always the same: make information usable, reduce friction, and
      help people work smarter.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="right-intro">
  <div id="intro-image">
    <Image src={avatar} alt="A graphic of Marina" />
  </div>
</div>
